# Paranal Airglow Line And Continuum Emission (PALACE) model: data and code of
# v1.0 (Noll et al. 2024)
# 
# Reference populations and intensities from the O2 population model for lines
# with HITRAN2020 data (intensities consistent with pmd_reflineint_mol.dat)
# 
# Column names:
# lam: vacuum wavelength in µm (HITRAN2020)
# ID: 13 characters describing upper and lower states (HITRAN2020)
#     (see pmd_reflineint_mol.dat for details)
# isot: isotopologue (1616 or 1618)
# eli: electronic upper state (a or b)
# vi: vibrational level of upper state
# Ni: rotational level of upper state
# Ei: energy of upper state in 1/cm (HITRAN2020)
# Aij: Einstein-A coefficient in 1/s (HITRAN2020)
# gi: statistical weight (HITRAN2020)
# y: natural logarithm of population (exp(y) in Rs)
# I: reference intensity in R (based on product of exp(y), Aij, and gi)
# 
# References:
# HITRAN2020: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jqsrt.2021.107949
# 
